<title>INDIA: Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</title>
<headline>Indian annualised interest rate on forward dollars.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are monthly annualised interest rates on forward dollar premia quoted by banks and brokers at 1600 IST. The rates are spot/one month to spot/six months.</p>
<p>	   C/S =  5.10 % (Discount)     C/S =  0.32 % (Discount)</p>
<p>	   O/N =  7.66 % (Discount)     O/N =  0.43 % (Discount)</p>
<p>	   T/N =  3.83 % (Discount)     T/N =  1.27 % (Discount)</p>
<p>		   April 28, 1997		    April 25, 1997</p>
<p>	  1 month forward =  1.02 %     1 month forward =  1.36 %</p>
<p>	  2 month forward =  2.55 %     2 month forward =  2.72 %</p>
<p>	  3 month forward =  3.52 %     3 month forward =  3.74 %</p>
<p>	  4 month forward =  4.17 %     4 month forward =  4.34 %</p>
<p>	  5 month forward =  4.42 %     5 month forward =  4.49 %</p>
<p>	  6 month forward =  4.42 %     6 month forward =  4.47 %</p>
<p>-- Bombay newsroom, 91-22-265 9000</p>
